# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scope: optional, lower-case, e.g. button, storybook, deps
# Subject: imperative mood, lower-case, no trailing period, max 100 chars
#
# Example:
#   feat(button): add secondary variant
#
#   Explain the motivation and note any breaking changes below.
